cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CourtDyn or its protocols, please cite the paper below."
title: "CourtDyn: a dynamics question-answering benchmark and four diagnostic protocols for vision-language models"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for "Order Without Magnitude: Fine-tuned
  Vision-Language Models Read Image-Plane Motion in Court Dynamics Question
  Answering". Contains the question generator, the four diagnostic protocols,
  the intervention builders, deterministic scorers, frozen per-cell results,
  sanitized per-item model outputs, and the CourtDyn-native LoRA adapter. Source imagery is
  not redistributed; see NOTICE.md.
type: software
